{
  "about": "3D text (effect \"extrude\"): the layers TextEffect.resolve gives, back to front — the farthest first, the letters drawn over the last — each an offset in page units (dx, dy to 6 places) and a colour. depth 0..100 (default 40), direction -180..180 (default 135; degrees, 0 right, 90 down), shading 0..100 (default 40); the block runs 0.004 x depth x fontSize back in floor(max(8, depth/2)) equal steps, none at depth 0; the side is the chosen colour or, on Auto, the ink with each channel times (1 - shading/100), rounded half up; layer k of n (n farthest) is the side darkened again by shading x k/n, each channel rounded half up. Shared row for row by both phones' tests (Android TextEffectsTest, iOS TextEffectSettingsTests).",
